l lang en/es/fr/de/ja, loopback 200 on all five, published content root mounted read-only" "PASS public HTTPS with verified TLS: / /es/ /fr/ /de/ /ja/ all 200" "PASS browser render of all five locales with translated titles, headings and body copy plus a working locale switcher; screenshots captured" "PASS services deploy gate run 32918337180: shell served, 2 assets reachable, locale fallback intact, content root read-only, TLS verified" "PASS knoxx.promethean.rest and proxx.promethean.rest unaffected across the caddy recreate"]}
