g them with --no-deps. The deploy chain will do this again on every run until the sandbox question is decided, so no further deploy was attempted.", :tests ["PASS knoxx#253 1189 tests / 4430 assertions; #254 1214 / 4537; #255 1236 / 4640 — all 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 compiler warnings" "PASS local docker builds of the devtools toolchain layer and the sandbox JDK layer before pushing" "PASS services run 32923694183: build-knoxx-backend, build-knoxx-devtools, build-knoxx-frontend, build-website, build-proxx, deploy-proxx, deploy-website all green" "FAIL services run 32923694183 deploy-knoxx: dependency knoxx-sandboxd is unhealthy" "PASS production restored: knoxx 200, knoxx/health 401, website 200 in all five locales, proxx 200" "PASS new surfaces live from 93dd126a: /api/publications/translations/dispatch 401 and /api/publications/translations/approvals 401 (present, authenticated); /api/publications/reconcile 404, correct for an image predating #255"]}
